2026-07-27T08:52:03.3623894Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3692733Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3693665Z i /tmp/RtmpIaDijD/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3694057Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3694524Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3695445Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3696120Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3697089Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3697810Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:52:03.3973096Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:52:03.4084723Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:52:03.4568244Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:52:03.4749859Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
